  "notes": "The undergraduate catalog references an external SAP policy rather than restating it, so undergraduate SAP rules are a coverage gap. The public international admission page states no F-1 full-time credit threshold, so none is asserted. Catalog refund language (100% through the second week) and calendar refund dates (25% deadlines) do not combine into a complete refund schedule and are not merged. sha256 is null for every source. Each page was located and read at its public URL on 2026-08-31, but the network egress available during collection could not re-download raw response bodies for hashing, so no digest is asserted rather than a fabricated one. Agent 5 owns hashing via tools/fetch_sources.py; digests must be populated by that pipeline (or an equivalent unrestricted re-fetch) before this sidecar can pass a schema that requires 64 hex characters. retrieved_at reflects the collection session on 2026-08-31."
}
